%% UC-17 — Sign in to admin portal (NextAuth + Keycloak)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher / Admin
    participant AP as Admin Panel (Next.js)
    participant NA as NextAuth (server)
    participant KC as Keycloak

    R->>AP: Open admin.<host>
    AP->>NA: getToken() in middleware.ts
    NA-->>AP: no session
    AP->>KC: Redirect to /auth (client hhh-admin, browser URL)
    R->>KC: Enter credentials
    KC-->>AP: Authorization code
    NA->>KC: Exchange code at internal URL (confidential client + secret)
    KC-->>NA: access_token (incl. realm_access.roles), id_token
    NA->>NA: JWT callback decodes roles from access_token
    alt roles include admin or researcher
        NA-->>AP: Session established
        AP-->>R: Dashboard (sidebar filtered by role)
    else missing role
        AP-->>R: Redirect /access-denied
    end
